  "description": "The Giant Tree, known as the “Masinmok,” is said to grant a wish to anyone who reaches its summit. Explorers who came to climb the Masinmok brought along slaves called “Lumberjacks” to take on the dangers in their place. To gain their freedom, Lumberjacks had to successfully complete 100 expeditions. Having completed 99 expeditions and with the end of his long life of slavery in sight, the young Lumberjack “Jack” embarks on his final journey.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
